    <description>Whether the point sits on the trans-European transport network, which decides the 1 January 2027 AFIR retrofit duty for existing points at 50 kW and above. Art. 2(3) AFIR defines along as within 3 km DRIVING distance of the nearest exit - a routing computation, not a radius - so Unbekannt is a first-class value here and must be resolved by a human, never defaulted to Kein TEN-T.</description>
